message: "If you use Factorlab in your research, cite it with these data."
type: software
title: Factorlab
abstract: >-
  Factorlab gives numbers for cross-sectional factors of 20 OKX USDT perpetual futures.
  It tests a factor that you give in a book with costs: a historical test, and a weekly
  forward test with a confidence sequence.
